			description: [
				"&7&oWhat to choose...&r"
				""
				"You will need to set up a Compressor to make Compressed Air. Right now you have two choices, either the Liquid Compressor, which runs off liquid fuel, or the Rotational Compressor, which uses Create Stress. Both have their pros and cons."
